<Site
  title="About · Ouijit"
  description="Ouijit is built by one person, Prentice Bjerkeseth. Free, open source under AGPL, no account and no telemetry, and the plan is to keep it that way.">
  <main class="compare-content about-content">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>
      A tool for working with coding agents should protect your focus and your judgement as you get more done
      with it, and it shouldn't need an account, a subscription, or a company behind it. Ouijit is free and
      open source under AGPL-3.0, with no telemetry. If it ever charges for something, that will be a feature
      with a running cost of its own, like hosted environments or sync.
    </p>
    <p>
      Many tools like this are raising venture money, getting acquired, or shutting down. I build Ouijit alone
      and intend to keep it that way.
    </p>
    <p class="about-sign"><a href="https://github.com/pbjer" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Prentice Bjerkeseth</a></p>
  </main>
</Site>
